# Code Review

Establish the requested baseline. Read `AGENTS.md` and only the relevant authority documents. Inspect starting status before the diff so existing work is not misattributed.

Trace changed behavior through its callers and consumers. Prioritize user-visible failures, crashes/data loss, contract and compatibility breaks, security/privacy issues, concurrency/resource bugs, architecture violations, and missing regression tests. Ignore cosmetic style unless an enforced rule or correctness concern depends on it.

Report actionable findings first, ordered by severity, with precise location, trigger, impact, and safe direction. Do not edit unless asked. If there are no findings, state coverage, tests observed/not run, and residual risks.
